save('privacy',page('Privacy Information','How contact forms and external links work on the Adox Global Ventures Oman website.',titleband('Privacy information','Your Enquiry.<br> Your Choice to Send.','A simple explanation of how this website handles contact details.')+'<section class="section"><div class="container article-body"><h2>Contact forms</h2><p>Information entered into the forms is used in your browser to prepare an email. The website does not automatically send or store that information. You choose whether to open your email app, review the message and send it to info@adoxglobal.om.</p><h2>Email and phone contact</h2><p>If you email or call Adox Global Ventures, the details you choose to share can be used to respond to your enquiry and discuss the requested services.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>The country selector links to the separate Adox India and Dubai websites. Their own privacy information applies when you visit them. This website loads the Raleway typeface from Google Fonts; your browser may contact Google’s font servers to retrieve it.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared with Adox Global Ventures, email <a href="mailto:info@adoxglobal.om">info@adoxglobal.om</a>.</p></div></section>',''))
